			title = "The Swarm",
			text = [=[The silithid do not act alone. Within each of the three hives stands a glyphed crystal, and the scholars of the {link:cenarion-circle}Cenarion Circle{/link} believe that the Qiraji, and other powers still unknown, send their messages to the swarm through them. Each hive has its own overlord, and the overlords gather when the glyphs call them.]=],
