		{ type = "quest", id = 8331 },
		{ type = "quest", id = 8361 },
	},
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Abyssal Council is a hierarchy of elemental nobles whom the {link:twilight-s-hammer}Twilight's Hammer{/link} serves in {link:silithus}Silithus{/link}. The cult calls them its masters, and speaks with them through the wind stones of its camps. The {link:cenarion-circle}Cenarion Circle{/link} has learned that {link:shadow-council}the Council{/link} controls the cult through those stones, and that the cultists take their orders from it.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Ranks",
			text = [=[At the bottom stand the templars: the Crimson, Azure, Hoary and Earthen Templars. Above them are four dukes: the Duke of Cynders, the Duke of Fathoms, the Duke of Zephyrs and the Duke of Shards. At the top sits the High Council of four lords: Prince Skaldrenox, High Marshal Whirlaxis, Baron Kazum and Lord Skwol.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Wind Stones",
			text = [=[The cult's own rules are strict. Initiates may call a templar, but they must wear the proper garb, or the stone's defences will wake. Only those who carry a medallion of station may speak with a duke. Only the Twilight Lords may call on the High Council, and any outsider who tries is to be burned to ash. A craftsman of the Circle has learned to forge the medallions. With one, and in the cult's own garb, a bold fighter may call a noble of {link:shadow-council}the Council{/link} out of the stone and strike it down.]=],
		},
	},
})

