			text = [=[{link:southwind-village}Southwind{/link} was an outpost of the night elves in the eastern desert. The book of the war says that {link:fandral-staghelm}Fandral{/link} ordered his son to defend it, a choice he would regret. A journal found in the ruins says that Valstann, eager to please his father, asked to go. The Twin Emperors of Ahn'Qiraj had hidden their armies beneath the sand, and the trap was not seen. The village was destroyed. General Rajaxx took Valstann to the front and killed him before his father's eyes. The ruins stand still, and the spirits of druids and sentinels walk them.]=],
