			text = [=[Baristolth of the Shifting Sands stands in {link:cenarion-hold}Cenarion Hold{/link} and looks toward the hives. A thousand years ago he lay maimed and near death. A great one breathed once upon his body and waited while the sands of time healed his wounds. Then Baristolth was bound to remain as a watcher for as long as he was needed. His watch has lasted ever since.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Baristolth is a living thread to the old war. He made a promise a thousand years ago, and he believes the hour to keep it has come. He feels the land shake around the hives, and he knows that the {link:qiraji}Qiraji{/link} are preparing for war.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He was saved from death and bound as a watcher.
• He watches the hives and feels the land shudder as the {link:qiraji}Qiraji{/link} plan for war.
